## WF-2: Detection Inline

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Auth API
    participant D as Detection API
    participant ML as ML API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over A,D: Sau khi login thành công (WF-1)

    A->>D: POST /internal/v1/detect<br/>(login_attempt_id, user_id, source_ip, ...)
    D->>DB: SELECT user history<br/>(fail_count_24h, ip_change_rate, ...)

    par Trích features
        D->>D: Tính rule_score<br/>(IP mới? Fail nhiều? Giờ lạ?)
    and Gọi ML
        D->>ML: POST /internal/v1/ml/score<br/>(features)
        ML-->>D: {anomaly_score, is_anomaly, reason_codes}
    end

    D->>DB: INSERT risk_assessment<br/>(rule_score, anomaly_score, ml_status, risk_level)

    alt risk_level IN (high, critical)
        D->>DB: INSERT alert (status=open, risk_level)
        D-->>A: 200 {alert_created: true}
    else risk_level IN (low, medium)
        D-->>A: 200 {alert_created: false}
    end

    Note over D: ML unavailable → ml_status=error<br/>→ risk_level = medium (fallback)
```

